+### TensoRF Grid Resolution Configuration
+Applies marching cubes with a percentile sweep on a 128^3 grid. Extreme threshold sensitivity makes the approach unreliable in practice, with errors of 22.4% at p=93, 92.8% at p=95, and 518.7% at p=99 [S4, unofficial].
+
+### TensoRF Baseline with DINO
+Constructs the DINO field which is factorized along 3 directions the same as its radiance field [S5].
